{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107630","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107630","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1610763001:0":{"text":"グレム……","source_cn":"格墨文……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D69C37DF97669CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610763002:0":{"text":"どうしたんですか、シュー？何か困ったことでもあったのですか？","source_cn":"休，你欲言又止，是遇到了什么很为难的事情吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCA865F1E70E4D96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610763003:0":{"text":"私に手伝えることがあれば、何でも言ってください。友だちに遠慮はいりませんよ。","source_cn":"如果需要帮忙的话，请告诉我。我将毫不犹豫地履行身为朋友...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB19352A31D343489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610763004:1":{"text":"グレム……俺、お前に謝りたいことがあるんだ。","source_cn":"我……格墨文，我想向你道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32D41506A49A07FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610763005:1":{"text":"シューは途切れ途切れながらも、自分がグレムと友だちになろうとした目的を打ち明けた。最後まで話し終えた時、大きな心のつっかえが取れたような表情をしていたが、きつく握りしめられた両の手が彼の緊張を物語っていた。","source_cn":"休艰难但坚决地将自己和格墨文交朋友时的心态和盘托出。说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F9C0C9CDAEC2830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610763006:0":{"text":"……そうだったんですね。まあ、とっくに知っていましたよ。","source_cn":"……原来真是这样啊。其实，我早就知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A423EE1DC214CDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610763007:1":{"text":"えっ？し、知ってた……？","source_cn":"格墨文？你……你知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F0EBD7B43C7B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610763008:1":{"text":"なんとなく気付いていた、と言うべきでしょうか。ですが、そんなこと私は少しも気にしていませんよ。","source_cn":"应该说，是我猜到的。但那又怎么样呢？我其实并不介意这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x105B324D88813853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610763009:1":{"text":"き、気にしてない……？","source_cn":"你……不介意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BAC61A3898CD3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610763010:1":{"text":"気を悪くしないでくださいね。ただ、表向きは親切でも、裏では利益をめぐって打算や裏切りが飛び交う――そんな貴族のやり方には、もう慣れているので。","source_cn":"恕我直言，我已经很习惯周旋于一个个贵族之间，表面看似热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0FE4D8B82F9272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610763011:1":{"text":"シュー、君は確かに私を利用したかもしれません。けれど今は、本当に私と友だちになりたいと思ってくれているのでしょう？そして、最終的に利益ではなく友情を選んだからこそ、こうして謝ってくれたのですよね？","source_cn":"而你，休，虽然你打算利用我接近王室，但你也是真心想和我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6978C4DC7E59831","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610763012:1":{"text":"私は人を見る目は確かだと自負しています。長いこと一緒にいますが、君の言動からは、一度も悪意を感じたことはありません。","source_cn":"我不会看错人的。我们认识这么久，你的一言一行都能体现出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B269A2562C3F83D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610763013:1":{"text":"君はグレンウォルド家の善良さと誠実さ、そして誇りを受け継いでいる。私の、唯一無二の親友ですよ。","source_cn":"你是格伦沃顿家族的后裔，你继承了祖先的善良、正直和荣誉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C15B2D2C356F23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610763014:0":{"text":"ですから、私に後ろめたさを感じることも、謝る必要もないのです。","source_cn":"所以，休，不要为此感到愧疚，也不需要为此道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77203FFFD8C4AE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610763015:1":{"text":"私は友だちとして、君が一族の栄光を取り戻せるよう願っています。だからこそ、力になれそうな人がいれば進んで紹介してきましたし、そうできることを嬉しく思っています。","source_cn":"作为朋友，我很希望你能实现你的愿望，重振家族荣光。所以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB028C388BCEF2CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610763016:1":{"text":"俺……もう、何て言ったらいいか。グレム……","source_cn":"……我，我不知道该说些什么，格墨文……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x647B8518870C9612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610763017:0":{"text":"こういうとき、言葉はむしろ意味を成さないものですよ。それで、どうしたんですか、シュー？まさか謝るためだけに私を探していたわけではないでしょう？","source_cn":"言语在这样的时刻总是苍白的。好了，休，你来找我不会就是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24903FD30C83CD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1610763017":{"text":"こういうとき、言葉はむしろ意味を成さないものですよ。それで、どうしたんですか、シュー？まさか謝るためだけに私を探していたわけではないでしょう？","source_cn":"言语在这样的时刻总是苍白的。好了，休，你来找我不会就是为了向我道歉吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24903FD30C83CD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610763019:1":{"text":"そういうことでしたか。赤い上級魔宝石……ライマン、「エヴァフレア」を持ってきてください。","source_cn":"我明白了。一枚高级的魔法红宝石……雷曼，将“恒火之星”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A5A97F79382F264","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1610763020:1":{"text":"ですが、坊ちゃま……あの宝石は、あなた様の新しい杖にとご用意された物では……","source_cn":"可是，格墨文少爷，这枚宝石是您为自己的新魔法杖所准备的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEDA116D98EFABD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_i